# Cephalid Inkmage {2}{U}, 2/2: "When this creature enters, surveil 3" (CR 701.25) and "Threshold - can't be blocked as long as there are
# seven or more cards in your graveyard" (CR 207.2c, 509.1b). Bot1 casts it with Black Lotus (graveyard 1), surveils three Islands into the graveyard
# (4) and Bolts Bot2 twice (6). On turn 3 with six it is blocked by Bot2's Memnite (which dies). After a third Bolt (7) Bot2's Ornithopter may not
# block it on turn 5. Bot2's own graveyard (the dead Memnite) is not Bot1's.

